#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXU): The national FHIR server of Onesa, behind the OHS FHIR Info Gateway (J4.0, J4.1): assembles each family member's IPS and DVCs, issues each as a passcode-protected Verifiable Health Link in an HCERT signed with Country B's DSC, hosts the manifests (ITI-YY5), checks passcode, expiry and consent on each request, and logs every access as an AuditEvent at home. Country B is played on the GDHCN DEV network by the test participant XXU, so no real ministry's key is implied."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of CHW app, Onesa (Country B): The registration and referral forms of the CHW app, FHIR Questionnaires filled in with Structured Data Capture, which also read the doses on a paper DVC (J2)."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Lomaru District Health Center EHR (Country B): Evaluates the infant immunization schedule of Onesa against the child's doses, imported ones included, and says which are due (J3)."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Lomaru District Health Center EHR (Country B): Maps a foreign vaccine product code to the Onesa EPI schedule code, which is added beside the original code on import (J3)."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Lomaru District Health Center EHR (Country B): The health centre's record of each patient, where imported immunizations are kept with their provenance (J3)."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Lomaru District Health Center EHR (Country B): Verifies a DVC's HCERT signature against the GDHCN trust list cached on the device (J3)."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Onesa national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXU): Answers a VHL manifest request after checking its signature, the passcode, the expiry and the consent, and logs each access in Onesa (J4.1)."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Onesa national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXU): Copies the portal's FHIR data into an analytics store for reporting."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Onesa national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXU): Holds each person's records (IPS, DVCs) as FHIR resources, from which the portal assembles what a VHL shares (J4.0, J4.1)."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Onesa national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXU): Identifies each person the portal serves, children and their households included."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Onesa national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXU): Issues a passcode-protected Verifiable Health Link per family member, in an HCERT signed with the document signer key of Onesa (J4.0)."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Onesa national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXU): Lists the clinics and health centres that record and share care."
msgstr ""

#: archimate/0.1.0/model.json:0
msgid "Onesa, part of Onesa national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXU): Lists the health workers, community health workers and nurses among them, who record care."
msgstr ""

